---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import HorizontalCard from "../components/HorizontalCard.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title = "Climate Data Assimilation" sideBarActiveItemID="da">
  <div>
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-5">Climate Data Assimilation</div>
  </div>

<div class="py-2 mb-6">
    <text class="text-lg prose">
    My doctoral research used climate data assimilation to reconstruct past climates.
    Data assimilation methods are statistical frameworks that integrate climate model
    simulations with observational products and natural climate archives. Synthesizing
    these data sources provides a more complete understanding of Earth's climate than a
    single source alone. My work used these methods to examine baseline climate dynamics, 
    in order to better understand future climate change.
    More specifically, I specialized in the development and application of 
    <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kalman_filter">Kalman filter</a>, 
    <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Particle_filter">particle filter</a>, 
    and <a href="https://journals.ametsoc.org/view/journals/clim/28/19/jcli-d-14-00802.1.xml">optimal sensor</a>
    assimilation techniques.
</div>

  <div>
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-2">Related Work</div>
  </div>

  <HorizontalCard
    title="DASH"
    img="/da/dash.png"
    desc="A MATLAB toolbox for paleoclimate data assimilation workflows."
    url="/climate-data-assimilation/dash"
    badge="GMD"
  /> 

  <div class="divider my-0"></div>

    <HorizontalCard
    title="Paleoclimate Data Assimilation Review"
    img="/da/review.png"
    desc="Check out our Annual Reviews article on paleoclimate data assimilation techniques."
    url="/climate-data-assimilation/review"
    badge="Annual Review"
  />

  <div class="divider my-0"></div>

  <HorizontalCard
    title="LGM Surface Temperatures"
    img="/da/lgm.png"
    desc="Check out our two Nature papers reconstructing global surface temperatures at the last glacial maximum."
    url="/climate-data-assimilation/lgm"
    badge="Nature"
  />

  <div class="divider my-0"></div>

  <HorizontalCard
    title="Southern Annular Mode"
    img="/da/sam.png"
    desc="Reconstructing the Southern Annular Mode over the last 2,000 years to better understand the southern hemisphere's climate."
    url="/climate-data-assimilation/sam"
    badge="NComms"
  />

